<graph edgedefault="undirected"><node id="Azure">
  <data key="d0">Azure</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure is Microsoft's cloud computing platform offering a wide range of services—including compute, networking, and data platform services—for deploying and managing applications and workloads. It provides datacenters, regions, and Availability Zones around the world, supporting zone-redundant and multi-region deployment approaches for mission-critical and highly available solutions. Azure offers subscriptions, infrastructure services, SLAs, various encryption models, and built-in failover and backup capabilities, while also requiring tailored backup solutions for disaster recovery scenarios.

As a hyperscale cloud environment, Azure supports differing feature-sets across languages, SDKs, and APIs, and enables MLOps workflow solutions for organizations to implement highly reliable cloud-based solutions. Microsoft also publishes content through Azure on advancing safe deployment practices.

Additionally, Azure refers to a network policy plugin for AKS (Azure Kubernetes Service) that uses Linux IPTables to enforce specified network policies.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure is Microsoft's cloud computing platform providing networking, compute, and other services.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure is a network policy plugin for AKS that uses Linux IPTables to enforce specified policies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e07a49a74635d695d2a74e26e941143f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3137621891148d2c190c438f188b4eb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77437de30be507969c1117574fed4849&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b2f79e880d3ae7cbc10150a4958b75f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4a64c702a6434c451dbfa718bffaf8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13da8c10e8b6b19647675081cbb79073&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ceea393f341ad536e3a85d5af262a1bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea9f3d6861109aed1a61babb89793d60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06f6956528b19bfc513c2a4b70a66e71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8200e1f0295324acfed0587523ace64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e21bfd072e50a8d166c6a4fdcae0f9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f86c34d935d91c0feba2784fca188c36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0de195b0afed20e3d851a968d363d0ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bdc71fab10e8d772205c8ac9acd6546&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-defd991d185ed0d546fc2887007b9160&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53e8384b0bc1068b56283b3c6b4bb02b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b31cf91ba30eab331729c73c4002b505&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c93cee43dab578364cd13532355256b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9935cc9222b0d130d80a116c87875301&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e44080944c7ed0bdb8917734103e726b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3c83649acd71df5d7f58cf6c4f1629c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba037f30d06665208af1b780fac7d88b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e92839392c86e80753e5e62c70459c56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0b79907727407bf3c0d7f73778f8c4f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0ea658bc5677a379a1105409b6be36f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac69076e8ebd4d001c0267c2edca19ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67203c92bdb0aa325b8ab2d546d9ef56</data>
