</node>
<node id="Scale-Unit Architecture">
  <data key="d0">Scale-Unit Architecture</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Scale-unit architecture is a design pattern that optimizes end-to-end scalability through compartmentalization, allowing logical units to be scaled independently.&lt;SEP&gt;Scale-unit architecture is a design pattern where regional resources are deployed as part of a deployment stamp corresponding to a scale unit.&lt;SEP&gt;Scale-unit architecture is a key practice for achieving zero-downtime deployment in mission-critical applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Scale-unit architecture is used in application design for building highly reliable applications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e07a49a74635d695d2a74e26e941143f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3137621891148d2c190c438f188b4eb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06f6956528b19bfc513c2a4b70a66e71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53e8384b0bc1068b56283b3c6b4bb02b</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-design.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-platform.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-overview.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776980036</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Mission-Critical Workload">
  <data key="d0">Mission-Critical Workload</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A mission-critical workload is a type of application workload that requires high resilience, availability, and careful architectural design.&lt;SEP&gt;A mission-critical workload is an application design pattern requiring high reliability, availability, and fault tolerance, often using multi-region deployment.&lt;SEP&gt;A mission-critical workload requires rigorous testing and the highest levels of reliability, capacity, and security.&lt;SEP&gt;A mission-critical workload is an application that must maintain high reliability and availability, requiring rigorous deployment and testing processes.&lt;SEP&gt;A mission-critical workload is an application design approach requiring high availability, redundancy, and globally distributed active-active architecture on Azure.&lt;SEP&gt;A mission-critical workload is a collection of application resources that must be highly reliable, always available, resilient to failures, and operational on the platform.&lt;SEP&gt;A mission-critical workload is an application design approach requiring high availability, redundancy, and globally distributed active-active architecture on Azure.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e07a49a74635d695d2a74e26e941143f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3137621891148d2c190c438f188b4eb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06f6956528b19bfc513c2a4b70a66e71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c437470f34ed638659632da76be560f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ff5c56a565c7a13e4cc5066c5ed0775&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53e8384b0bc1068b56283b3c6b4bb02b</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-design.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-platform.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-networking-connectivity.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-overview.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776983287</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Azure Well-Architected Framework">
  <data key="d0">Azure Well-Architected Framework</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Azure Well-Architected Framework is a set of guiding tenets and pillars for improving the quality of workloads on Azure. It provides comprehensive guidance across multiple areas including reliability, operational excellence, and workload monitoring. The framework includes a mission-critical workload series specifically focused on designing mission-critical applications on Azure. It offers checklist recommendations such as RE:09 for disaster recovery planning and guidance on safe deployment practices for operational excellence.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Well-Architected Framework is a set of design pillars and principles for architecting workloads on Azure.&lt;SEP&gt;A framework with core pillars including Reliability, Cost Optimization, Performance Efficiency, Operational Excellence, and Security.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e07a49a74635d695d2a74e26e941143f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3137621891148d2c190c438f188b4eb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a324803e46dec295e5d9abb5a43f8a29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-579193d2ba0036e6c770c9b7c78ebbdc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86643535bbddea59b9f2b171ec6790db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e86188fe80b60fb0b86bacfbd8970add&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db85d35bad38238654d528c03dcdbee8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44641efcd9d3edd6dd3a0ceda8c1536b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84ce425f3646f4ada6cca51a61f53897&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f88755bbf9fb155be427dfc8a8708cc</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-design.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-platform.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-operational-procedures.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/reliability/disaster-recovery.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/reliability/failure-mode-analysis.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/reliability/redundancy.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/operational-excellence/principles.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/operational-excellence/safe-deployments.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/cost-optimization/tradeoffs.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/design-guides/regions-availability-zones.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776981741</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Deployment Stamp">
  <data key="d0">Deployment Stamp</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A deployment stamp is an architecture pattern that covers related components and can be used as a regional unit for provisioning and scaling.&lt;SEP&gt;A deployment stamp is a regional deployment unit that typically corresponds to a scale unit within a region.&lt;SEP&gt;An ephemeral unit containing both infrastructure and application deployed together, treated as short-lived with a lifecycle tied to a single release.&lt;SEP&gt;A deployment stamp is a regional deployment unit placed in a dedicated subscription so subscription limits apply only within a single stamp.&lt;SEP&gt;A deployment stamp is an independent regional deployment unit that can be constrained to a single zone with multiple stamps across zones for redundancy.&lt;SEP&gt;A deployment stamp is an independent regional deployment unit that can be constrained to a single zone with multiple stamps across zones for redundancy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e07a49a74635d695d2a74e26e941143f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3137621891148d2c190c438f188b4eb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c437470f34ed638659632da76be560f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8200e1f0295324acfed0587523ace64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd5df507c6d7ae6d803dce8c99d84eb9</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-design.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-platform.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-networking-connectivity.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776983281</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Scale Unit">
  <data key="d0">Scale Unit</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A scale unit is a logical unit or function that can be scaled independently, composed of code components, hosting platforms, and deployment stamps.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e07a49a74635d695d2a74e26e941143f</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-design.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776979321</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Global Distribution">
  <data key="d0">Global Distribution</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Global distribution is a strategy for deploying applications in an active/active model across multiple regions to withstand regional and zone failures.&lt;SEP&gt;Global distribution is a design pattern for distributing traffic and resources across multiple Azure regions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e07a49a74635d695d2a74e26e941143f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3137621891148d2c190c438f188b4eb5</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-design.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-platform.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776979406</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Azure Landing Zone">
  <data key="d0">Azure Landing Zone</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Landing Zone is a foundational deployment framework and pattern in Microsoft Azure that provides a subscription-based environment dedicated to applications, establishing clear management boundaries. It serves as a deployment environment supporting integration with broader organizational network topology, offering connectivity to on-premises data centers and networks through technologies such as ExpressRoute or virtual networks.

Azure Landing Zone includes deployment configurations such as Online and Corp. Connected variants, catering to different network connectivity scenarios. It incorporates security capabilities including Azure Firewall or equivalent network virtual appliance (NVA) resources, providing additional threat mitigation through centralized security features. Centralized baseline policy assignments are applied at both management group and subscription levels.

The framework also supports centralized storage of operational data, enabling data forking to both centralized tooling and application-dedicated Log Analytics workspaces to meet diverse monitoring and operational requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure landing zones provide deployment configurations including Online and Corp. Connected variants for different network connectivity scenarios.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure landing zone is a deployment pattern that provides connectivity to on-premises networks using ExpressRoute or virtual networks.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure landing zone is a deployment framework for integrating with broader organizational network topology.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Landing Zone is a foundational platform deployment pattern that includes Azure Firewall or equivalent NVA resources.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e07a49a74635d695d2a74e26e941143f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bc4a6aa7dad91160ab49f8c99c2ea47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bdc71fab10e8d772205c8ac9acd6546&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c136188a7c5b35c34dacbc95825b4191&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd5df507c6d7ae6d803dce8c99d84eb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adc31ff972bb32047bd652b7c4ab8132&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc6c19c90a7ec75e7d95d807c1817fcf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9406ed2aa903d9c51a1e6e1d68aee2dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0151994e0d96a2045a761ce543e6d2a3</data>
