  <data key="d0">Circuit Breaker</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A design pattern used to handle non-transient failures and improve application resiliency.&lt;SEP&gt;A design pattern that provides stability by waiting for recovery or quickly rejecting requests rather than blocking while waiting for unavailable services.</data>
