  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The ability of applications to handle failures gracefully, a core theme addressed by multiple design patterns and recommendations.&lt;SEP&gt;Building resiliency includes adding redundancy to infrastructure, data, and networking, and following best practices like breaking monolithic applications into microservices.</data>
