  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A logging approach recommended for all log messages, using a unified operational data sink for traces, metrics, and logs.&lt;SEP&gt;Structured logging is a recommended practice for application code instrumentation.&lt;SEP&gt;Structured logging is a logging approach recommended for all log messages to improve observability.</data>
