<node id="Availability Zones">
  <data key="d0">Availability Zones</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Availability Zones are physically separate datacenter locations within an Azure region, each with independent power, cooling, and networking infrastructure. They follow a 3+1 datacenter model and are designed to provide datacenter-level fault tolerance and high availability, with less than 2 milliseconds latency between them.

Availability Zones maximize resilience by distributing workloads—such as VMs, AKS components, and data replicas—across these physically separated datacenters within a region. This zone redundancy ensures resiliency to zone failures for services including Azure Cosmos DB and other regional deployments. When used with Azure Standard Load Balancer, they enable a 99.99% SLA.

While Availability Zones are critical for reliable intra-region deployment configurations, spreading resources across them can affect performance due to inter-zone latency. They serve as fundamental infrastructure isolation units within Azure regions, enabling organizations to distribute solution components for maximum availability, redundancy, and resilience.&lt;SEP&gt;Availability Zones are Azure infrastructure zones that enable 99.99% SLA when Azure Standard Load Balancer is deployed across them.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3ed4331e930dc66a90d716e75ccb847e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3137621891148d2c190c438f188b4eb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c97b53f9c2bcaf2eaf8ee6eff46b6b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-340142470ca89eaa216bdbb33d95053a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77437de30be507969c1117574fed4849&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db1b2af74d4d806b70803e4d1daf8a47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32d784320f22fc18cf5d44108f55403f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd806d5f85dca98a80362955d10e7ef7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f86c34d935d91c0feba2784fca188c36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adc31ff972bb32047bd652b7c4ab8132&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0151994e0d96a2045a761ce543e6d2a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e86188fe80b60fb0b86bacfbd8970add&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96ee1cd59b7faad09ea96a1e39a65bcd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3c83649acd71df5d7f58cf6c4f1629c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f88755bbf9fb155be427dfc8a8708cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0ea658bc5677a379a1105409b6be36f</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-design.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-platform.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-data-platform.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-design-principles.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-networking-connectivity.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-security.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/reliability/redundancy.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/design-guides/regions-availability-zones.md</data>
