  <data key="d2">Proximity placement groups minimize internode latency when colocation latency is a concern in AKS deployments.&lt;SEP&gt;Proximity Placement Groups enable submillisecond latency between services by co-locating resources.&lt;SEP&gt;Proximity Placement Groups enable submillisecond latency between services by co-locating resources.</data>
