  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Virtual Machines serve as the primary IaaS hosting model for constrained migrations of on-premises applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Virtual Machines are IaaS VMs provided by Azure for hosting applications in the cloud.</data>
