  <data key="d2">Azure Virtual Machine Scale Sets provide automatic scaling, health monitoring, and automatic repair of unhealthy instances.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Virtual Machine Scale Sets is a service supporting multiple instances directly, such as setting five instances.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Virtual Machine Scale Sets is an Azure service that supports zone-redundant deployments.&lt;SEP&gt;An Azure service that supports zone-redundant deployments.</data>
