<node id="Mission-Critical Workloads">
  <data key="d0">Mission-Critical Workloads</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Mission-critical workloads require high levels of reliability and fault tolerance in application deployment.&lt;SEP&gt;Mission-critical workloads are applications requiring high reliability, with baseline architectures recommending containerization and container orchestrators.&lt;SEP&gt;Mission-critical workloads are applications and systems that require high availability and reliability on Azure.&lt;SEP&gt;Mission-critical workloads are applications requiring high reliability, with architecture varying by business requirements and acceptable downtime.&lt;SEP&gt;Mission-critical workloads are significant applications in scale and complexity that require maximized reliability on Azure.&lt;SEP&gt;Mission-critical workloads on Azure are designed to maximize reliability so applications remain performant and available.&lt;SEP&gt;Mission-critical workloads are systems that should use both multiple availability zones and multiple regions for the highest reliability.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-340142470ca89eaa216bdbb33d95053a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9594ebe8dcfee62791f577e9716caf2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b2f79e880d3ae7cbc10150a4958b75f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e21bfd072e50a8d166c6a4fdcae0f9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0de195b0afed20e3d851a968d363d0ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b31cf91ba30eab331729c73c4002b505&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0b79907727407bf3c0d7f73778f8c4f</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-platform.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-architecture-pattern.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-design-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-health-modeling.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-security.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/design-guides/regions-availability-zones.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776981747</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
