  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Functions is a serverless compute platform where application logic runs as distinct functions in response to events.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Functions is a service that can bind to the change feed processor to process items into storage for custom backups.&lt;SEP&gt;An Azure service that supports zone-redundant deployments.</data>
