<node id="Private Endpoints">
  <data key="d0">Private Endpoints</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Private endpoints restrict access to private virtual networks and mitigate data exfiltration risks for Container Registry and Azure Functions.&lt;SEP&gt;Private Endpoints provide private connectivity to Azure platform services within a virtual network.&lt;SEP&gt;Private Endpoints are a security convention that can be enforced through Azure Policy.&lt;SEP&gt;Private Endpoints provide private connectivity to Azure platform services within a virtual network.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ca8c0f8ea5cbe84839aac1d60b8bbdaa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bdc71fab10e8d772205c8ac9acd6546&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0151994e0d96a2045a761ce543e6d2a3</data>
