  <data key="d5">1776983283</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Web Application Firewall">
  <data key="d0">Web Application Firewall</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A web application firewall (WAF) provides protection for HTTP endpoints from common external attack vectors when using Azure Functions HTTP triggers.&lt;SEP&gt;Web Application Firewall (WAF) provides protection from common web exploits and vulnerabilities such as SQL injection.&lt;SEP&gt;Web Application Firewall provides protection against common web exploits such as SQL injection and cross-site scripting.&lt;SEP&gt;Web Application Firewall (WAF) provides protection from common web exploits and vulnerabilities such as SQL injection.&lt;SEP&gt;Web Application Firewall provides protection against common web exploits such as SQL injection and cross-site scripting.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ca8c0f8ea5cbe84839aac1d60b8bbdaa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38a9b32aa690001ea5387c320074295c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6ee1b46c13062b2f84bc4bd8740f6c3</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-platform.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-networking-connectivity.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776983280</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
