  <data key="d0">Infrastructure As A Service</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Infrastructure as a service (IaaS) is a cloud computing model using virtualization and VMs as the primary hosting model for constrained migrations.&lt;SEP&gt;Infrastructure as a service (IaaS) solutions typically support zonal deployments in Azure.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ca8c0f8ea5cbe84839aac1d60b8bbdaa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba037f30d06665208af1b780fac7d88b</data>
