  <data key="d0">Analytical Store</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A column-format store in Azure Cosmos DB optimized for analytical queries, addressing complexity and latency challenges of traditional ETL pipelines.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-caad63f908cd3b639ca5d51c5a2341ae</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-data-platform.md</data>
