  <data key="d5">1776981473</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dependabot">
  <data key="d0">Dependabot</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Dependabot is a tool for GitHub repositories that automatically keeps repositories up to date with the latest releases of dependent packages and applications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c97a1db66c7ecde12774487f7afb1593</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776979677</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Azure DevOps">
  <data key="d0">Azure DevOps</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure DevOps is a platform whose capabilities overlap with GitHub and can be used together for deployment and management.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure DevOps is a deployment tooling platform with a rich feature set, hosted in a single Azure region.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure DevOps is a CI/CD tooling platform that uses service connections and build agents for deployment pipelines.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c97a1db66c7ecde12774487f7afb1593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ecbdde6d262012ebbdfa789102231a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9406ed2aa903d9c51a1e6e1d68aee2dc</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-security.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776980103</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Load Testing">
  <data key="d0">Load Testing</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A testing method that generates synthetic user load, typically performed in parallel with chaos testing.&lt;SEP&gt;Load testing validates scalability and application operation by increasing load rapidly or gradually until a predetermined threshold is reached.&lt;SEP&gt;Load testing determines whether a system risks exceeding Azure service limits during expected production load and helps set appropriate autoscaling thresholds.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c97a1db66c7ecde12774487f7afb1593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c437470f34ed638659632da76be560f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8200e1f0295324acfed0587523ace64</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776979677</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Failure Mode Analysis">
  <data key="d0">Failure Mode Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Failure mode analysis involves introducing faults into applications and infrastructure to assess redundancy mechanisms, identifying risk, impact, and breadth of impact.&lt;SEP&gt;FMA is a method to identify potential failures in a workload, including dependencies and failure points.&lt;SEP&gt;Failure Mode Analysis (FMA) is a method for identifying potential failure points in application flows, assessing their likelihood and severity, and planning mitigation strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;Failure mode analysis (FMA) is the practice of identifying potential points of failure within a workload and associated flows, and planning mitigation actions to minimize the widespread effect of failures.&lt;SEP&gt;Failure Mode Analysis (FMA) is a method for identifying potential failure modes, their likelihood, and effects on workloads, documented across Azure infrastructure.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c97a1db66c7ecde12774487f7afb1593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efa918a51cded76ba3c94dc0ae8e7139&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21f771a609846ef0b7b2580d4b2e3191&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12a80a8926c38685348cb6badf1d2485&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86643535bbddea59b9f2b171ec6790db</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/reliability/checklist.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/reliability/failure-mode-analysis.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776981041</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Mission Critical Online">
  <data key="d0">Mission Critical Online</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A reference implementation on GitHub that provides an example of a user load generator.&lt;SEP&gt;Mission Critical Online is a reference implementation with an example failure mode analysis for outage risks of individual components.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c97a1db66c7ecde12774487f7afb1593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c437470f34ed638659632da76be560f</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776979677</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Stress Testing">
  <data key="d0">Stress Testing</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Stress testing applies activities that overload existing resources to determine solution limits and verify the system's ability to recover gracefully.&lt;SEP&gt;Stress testing helps identify limitations of system components such as network components or databases that cannot appropriately scale.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c97a1db66c7ecde12774487f7afb1593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8200e1f0295324acfed0587523ace64</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776979678</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Smoke Tests">
  <data key="d0">Smoke Tests</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Smoke tests are run as part of every deployment to validate basic application functionality.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c97a1db66c7ecde12774487f7afb1593</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776979678</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Chaos Experiments">
  <data key="d0">Chaos Experiments</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Chaos experiments are run alongside load tests to validate application performance and operability through failure injection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c97a1db66c7ecde12774487f7afb1593</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776979678</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Blue/Green Deployments">
  <data key="d0">Blue/Green Deployments</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Blue/green deployments is a deployment strategy that requires the use of IaC with fully automated deployments.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c97a1db66c7ecde12774487f7afb1593</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776979678</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="GitHub">
  <data key="d0">GitHub</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">GitHub is a platform for source control and code repositories, recommended for storing source code.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0ecbdde6d262012ebbdfa789102231a4</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776979678</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="AIOps">
  <data key="d0">AIOps</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">AIOps refers to applying AI methodologies in CI/CD pipelines to detect regressions and prevent negative deployment impacts.&lt;SEP&gt;AIOps refers to models that analyze and correlate application observability data from various environments.&lt;SEP&gt;AIOps is a methodology applying machine learning to correlate and prioritize operational data, enabling detection, diagnosis, and prediction of system issues.&lt;SEP&gt;AIOps refers to the use of AI and ML models for IT operations, including model training, scoring, and continuous improvement.&lt;SEP&gt;AIOps is considered for continually improving operational procedures and triggers.&lt;SEP&gt;AI for IT operations (AIOps) enhances operational efficiency by using health data as input for machine learning models to analyze trends and predict issues.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0ecbdde6d262012ebbdfa789102231a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea9f3d6861109aed1a61babb89793d60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4678f659d2199619f053d40287ff2e4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a6891eb227254197568b44bf03596d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a324803e46dec295e5d9abb5a43f8a29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d847dca2d14a4e01f2ac8a1fb0f3723</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-health-modeling.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-operational-procedures.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/design-guides/health-modeling.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776981628</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="MLOps Workflow">
  <data key="d0">MLOps Workflow</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">MLOps workflow is a recommended approach for operationalizing machine learning models in DevOps processes.&lt;SEP&gt;MLOps workflow is a recommended approach for machine learning operations, hosted on Azure.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0ecbdde6d262012ebbdfa789102231a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea9f3d6861109aed1a61babb89793d60</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776979678</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Branching Strategy">
  <data key="d0">Branching Strategy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A branching strategy ensures maximum reliability by enabling parallel development and a clear path from development to production.&lt;SEP&gt;A branching strategy supports friction-free release of independent and interdependent features, bug fixes, and hotfixes within source control.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0ecbdde6d262012ebbdfa789102231a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db85d35bad38238654d528c03dcdbee8</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/operational-excellence/principles.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776981373</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="GitHub AE">
  <data key="d0">GitHub AE</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">GitHub AE is a GitHub enterprise version that can be used for storing code repositories.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0ecbdde6d262012ebbdfa789102231a4</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776979679</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="CI/CD Pipelines">
  <data key="d0">CI/CD Pipelines</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">CI/CD pipelines are continuous integration and continuous deployment processes that emit telemetry and can be enhanced with AIOps methodologies.&lt;SEP&gt;Continuous integration and deployment pipelines used to validate application health after code and configuration updates.&lt;SEP&gt;CI/CD pipelines are automated pipelines used for continuous integration and deployment of application updates.&lt;SEP&gt;CI/CD pipelines are automated deployment pipelines that should be predeployed in every region for immediate disaster recovery use.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0ecbdde6d262012ebbdfa789102231a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0de195b0afed20e3d851a968d363d0ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc6c19c90a7ec75e7d95d807c1817fcf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c93cee43dab578364cd13532355256b</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-health-modeling.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-security.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/reliability/disaster-recovery.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776980998</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Data Virtualization">
  <data key="d0">Data Virtualization</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Data virtualization is a modern analytics approach that enables ongoing analysis without requiring ETL and data movement.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0ecbdde6d262012ebbdfa789102231a4</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776979679</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="DevOps">
  <data key="d0">DevOps</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">DevOps is a process for which data collection and analysis are recommended, including telemetry and deployment metrics.&lt;SEP&gt;DevOps combines development and operational processes into a single engineering function, encompassing the entire application lifecycle with automation and CI/CD.&lt;SEP&gt;DevOps is a set of deployment methods used to drive effective and consistent operational procedures.&lt;SEP&gt;DevOps is a community of practice emphasizing collaboration, shared responsibility, and ownership between development and operations teams to continuously improve system design and processes.&lt;SEP&gt;DevOps is an approach that integrates specializations from multiple disciplines to create rigorous design and development practices.&lt;SEP&gt;DevOps is a methodology that recommends minimizing process variance, reducing human error, and increasing value return for workloads.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ea9f3d6861109aed1a61babb89793d60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a324803e46dec295e5d9abb5a43f8a29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1be68d72fe0d93ad1cb453304822afbf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06fa22ab48be5657235d1672d0089037&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aeefe2d63573562646e740d09fa6d491&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e9454754aa8d04d2fcd10f9b4227d89</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-operational-procedures.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-overview.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/operational-excellence/principles.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/operational-excellence/checklist.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/operational-excellence/tradeoffs.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776981433</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Zero-Downtime Deployment">
  <data key="d0">Zero-Downtime Deployment</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Zero-downtime deployment is a fundamental goal for mission-critical applications, ensuring availability even during new releases.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-06f6956528b19bfc513c2a4b70a66e71</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776979679</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="CI/CD">
  <data key="d0">CI/CD</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Continuous integration and continuous deployment pipelines designed to support frequent deployments for mission-critical workloads.&lt;SEP&gt;Continuous Integration and Continuous Deployment automation that enables short-lived development environments and promotes developer agility.&lt;SEP&gt;CI/CD is a process used for deployment updates, operational readiness tests, and running real-time scoring for AIOps scenarios.&lt;SEP&gt;Continuous integration and continuous delivery, a practice supported by DevOps for automated deployment operations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-06f6956528b19bfc513c2a4b70a66e71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3f13da121cb986a81d213029e9150d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4678f659d2199619f053d40287ff2e4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a324803e46dec295e5d9abb5a43f8a29</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-design-principles.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-health-modeling.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-operational-procedures.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776980007</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Mission-Critical Online">
  <data key="d0">Mission-Critical Online</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Mission-Critical Online is a reference implementation illustrating zero-downtime deployment on Azure.&lt;SEP&gt;Mission-Critical Online is a reference implementation available at GitHub providing a comprehensive health model example.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-06f6956528b19bfc513c2a4b70a66e71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aee778ccfa3886c52f485cafeef0009b</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-health-modeling.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776979831</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Azure Mission-Critical Connected">
  <data key="d0">Azure Mission-Critical Connected</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Mission-Critical Connected is a reference implementation illustrating zero-downtime deployment on Azure.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-06f6956528b19bfc513c2a4b70a66e71</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md</data>
