</node>
<node id="Anomaly Detection">
  <data key="d0">Anomaly Detection</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Anomaly Detection is a capability provided by Azure Cognitive Services that should be evaluated within the observability data stream for AIOps.&lt;SEP&gt;Anomaly Detection is an Azure Cognitive Service that flags unexpected variances in observability data streams.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4678f659d2199619f053d40287ff2e4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a6891eb227254197568b44bf03596d7</data>
