</node>
<node id="Regional Deployment Stamp">
  <data key="d0">Regional Deployment Stamp</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A regional deployment stamp is an independent deployment unit within a region that can be taken out of circulation if dependencies become unhealthy.&lt;SEP&gt;A regional deployment stamp is an independent deployment unit within a region that can be taken out of circulation if dependencies become unhealthy.</data>
