<node id="Virtual Network">
  <data key="d0">Virtual Network</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A virtual network is a fundamental networking construct in Azure that enables private connectivity between resources.&lt;SEP&gt;A virtual network is a fundamental networking construct in Azure that enables private connectivity between resources.</data>
