</node>
<node id="Azure Front Door Premium">
  <data key="d0">Azure Front Door Premium</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Front Door Premium supports private endpoints, enabling internet traffic to flow directly onto Azure virtual networks without public IPs.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Front Door Premium can route directly from edge nodes to private application endpoints.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Front Door Premium supports private endpoints, enabling internet traffic to flow directly onto Azure virtual networks without public IPs.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Front Door Premium can route directly from edge nodes to private application endpoints.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4bdc71fab10e8d772205c8ac9acd6546&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce015784fd1d8129dac8c9bbf32bf565</data>
