</node>
<node id="Azure Bastion">
  <data key="d0">Azure Bastion</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Bastion is a fully platform-managed PaaS service providing secure RDP/SSH connectivity to Azure VMs without requiring public IP addresses.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Bastion provides proxied private connections to access the data plane of Azure resources or perform management operations.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Bastion provides secure access to Azure Virtual Machines and administrative tasks on Azure PaaS over the Internet.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Bastion is a service for secure remote access to Virtual Machines without exposing them to the public internet.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Bastion is a fully platform-managed PaaS service providing secure RDP/SSH connectivity to Azure VMs without requiring public IP addresses.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Bastion provides proxied private connections to access the data plane of Azure resources or perform management operations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4bdc71fab10e8d772205c8ac9acd6546&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c136188a7c5b35c34dacbc95825b4191&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9406ed2aa903d9c51a1e6e1d68aee2dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0151994e0d96a2045a761ce543e6d2a3</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-networking-connectivity.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-security.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776983283</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Virtual Private Network">
  <data key="d0">Virtual Private Network</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">VPN provides aggregated bandwidth up to 10 Gbps in hub-and-spoke networks and up to 20 Gbps in Azure Virtual WAN.&lt;SEP&gt;VPN provides aggregated bandwidth up to 10 Gbps in hub-and-spoke networks and up to 20 Gbps in Azure Virtual WAN.</data>
