  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Service Endpoints provide connectivity to Azure services that don't support Private Link, with data exfiltration risk considerations.&lt;SEP&gt;Service Endpoints provide connectivity to Azure services that don't support Private Link, with data exfiltration risk considerations.</data>
