  <data key="d0">Blue-Green Deployments</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Blue-green deployments are a deployment strategy using parallel subnets to facilitate updated regional deployment stamps.&lt;SEP&gt;Blue-green deployments use parallel subnets to facilitate updated regional deployment stamps.&lt;SEP&gt;Blue-green deployments are a deployment strategy using parallel subnets to facilitate updated regional deployment stamps.&lt;SEP&gt;Blue-green deployments use parallel subnets to facilitate updated regional deployment stamps.</data>
