  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Microsoft Azure backbone is the network infrastructure ensuring connectivity between public endpoints hosted on Azure without traversing the public internet.&lt;SEP&gt;The Microsoft Azure backbone is the network infrastructure ensuring connectivity between public endpoints hosted on Azure without traversing the public internet.</data>
