<node id="Kubenet">
  <data key="d0">Kubenet</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Kubenet is a network plugin for AKS suitable for scenarios with limited available IP addresses.&lt;SEP&gt;A lightweight networking model where AKS nodes integrate within a virtual network but pods exist in a virtual overlay network.&lt;SEP&gt;Kubenet is a lightweight network plugin recommended for scenarios with limited IP address ranges.&lt;SEP&gt;Kubenet is a network plugin for AKS suitable for scenarios with limited available IP addresses.&lt;SEP&gt;A lightweight networking model where AKS nodes integrate within a virtual network but pods exist in a virtual overlay network.&lt;SEP&gt;Kubenet is a lightweight network plugin recommended for scenarios with limited IP address ranges.</data>
