  <data key="d0">Azure NAT Gateway</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure NAT Gateway is a scalable NAT solution supporting 64,000 connections per assigned outbound IP address, with up to 16 IP addresses per gateway.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure NAT Gateway mitigates port exhaustion issues.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure NAT Gateway is a scalable NAT solution supporting 64,000 connections per assigned outbound IP address, with up to 16 IP addresses per gateway.</data>
