  <data key="d0">Azure Load Balancer</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Load Balancer provides direct internet outbound connectivity for virtual machines or compute instances.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Load Balancer is a replica-aware load balancing service.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Load Balancer provides direct internet outbound connectivity for virtual machines or compute instances.</data>
