  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">An Azure region is a geographic area containing one or more Availability Zones and data centers.&lt;SEP&gt;An Azure region is a geographic perimeter containing a set of datacenters, with various configurations known as region architectures.&lt;SEP&gt;An Azure region is a geographic area containing one or more Availability Zones and data centers.</data>
