  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Web Application Firewall provides security capabilities to block or detect suspicious requests on publicly exposed endpoints.&lt;SEP&gt;Web Application Firewall provides security capabilities to block or detect suspicious requests on publicly exposed endpoints.</data>
