</node>
<node id="DevSecOps">
  <data key="d0">DevSecOps</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">DevSecOps expands DevOps by integrating security monitoring, application audits, and quality assurance throughout the application lifecycle.&lt;SEP&gt;DevSecOps is a practice that integrates security testing within CI/CD pipelines.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a324803e46dec295e5d9abb5a43f8a29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc6c19c90a7ec75e7d95d807c1817fcf</data>
