  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Azure Key Vault">
  <data key="d0">Azure Key Vault</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Key Vault is a secret management solution that supports expiry settings, key rotation, and alerting for upcoming expirations.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Key Vault is a secure repository for secrets, certificates, and keys, providing high availability, redundancy, and a security boundary with transaction limits and HSM backing.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Key Vault is a secure storage service for secrets and keys.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Key Vault is a secret/key management solution used as a typical internal dependency in workloads.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Key Vault is a global Azure service with automatic redundancy across multiple regions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-98dfe7557b9ff125211f2a2e03cb3dce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8deba810ca14d9b278b1f9d887802f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0151994e0d96a2045a761ce543e6d2a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86643535bbddea59b9f2b171ec6790db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e86188fe80b60fb0b86bacfbd8970add</data>
