  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Virtual Machine Scale Sets enable capabilities like scale, autoscale, and zone redundancy.&lt;SEP&gt;Virtual Machine Scale Sets enable capabilities like scale, autoscale, and zone redundancy, preferred over individual VMs.&lt;SEP&gt;Virtual Machine Scale Sets is a zone-redundant compute solution that automatically spreads VMs across availability zones.</data>
