<node id="Network Virtual Appliance">
  <data key="d0">Network Virtual Appliance</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Network Virtual Appliance (NVA) is an alternative to Azure Firewall Premium for deep packet inspection or TLS inspection requirements.</data>
