<node id="Network Time Protocol">
  <data key="d0">Network Time Protocol</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Network Time Protocol (NTP) provides accurate system time via an NTP server, serving as a critical dependency for security verification.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7e2cc133f2276ccf7c79c3147bf59683</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/security/tradeoffs.md</data>
