<node id="Observability Framework">
  <data key="d0">Observability Framework</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An observability framework requires architecture components to allocate resources for creating, collecting, and streaming logs and metrics.&lt;SEP&gt;A framework requiring architecture components to allocate time and resources for creating, collecting, and streaming logs and metrics.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-31da0f57b1bbfcf80aeba441d56d15f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c68f04b50833c59213a11d31e461972</data>
