  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Software Development Lifecycle">
  <data key="d0">Software Development Lifecycle</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The software development lifecycle (SDLC) encompasses planning, design, development, testing, and monitoring activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Software Development Lifecycle (SDLC) refers to practices that may need to evolve as architecture, business requirements, and team structure change.&lt;SEP&gt;SDLC provides rigor, consistency, specificity, and prioritization to change management in a workload.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-31da0f57b1bbfcf80aeba441d56d15f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcd6623608bb76388ae9e58c2350270b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d1d75683e73385fab74d25019f702cd</data>
