  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Health Models">
  <data key="d0">Health Models</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Health models provide in-depth visibility into workload components and overall health, used to validate deployments before each phase of progressive exposure.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-44641efcd9d3edd6dd3a0ceda8c1536b</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/operational-excellence/safe-deployments.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776981472</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bake Time">
  <data key="d0">Bake Time</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Bake time is the waiting period between rollout groups, measured in hours and days, allowing monitoring of workload health across different user patterns.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-44641efcd9d3edd6dd3a0ceda8c1536b</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/operational-excellence/safe-deployments.md</data>
