  <data key="d0">Rolling Back</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Rolling back is a recovery method that undoes deployment changes and reverts to the last known working configuration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a688a846e77a6107a53c8f43220265c2</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/operational-excellence/safe-deployments.md</data>
