</node>
<node id="Staging Environments">
  <data key="d0">Staging Environments</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Staging environments mirror production environments and allow testing changes in a controlled setting before deploying to live environments.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a688a846e77a6107a53c8f43220265c2</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/operational-excellence/safe-deployments.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776981477</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Trunk-Based Branching">
  <data key="d0">Trunk-Based Branching</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A branching structure that enforces tightly synced collaboration across the development team, recommended over Gitflow or environment-based branching.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a688a846e77a6107a53c8f43220265c2</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/operational-excellence/safe-deployments.md</data>
