  <data key="d0">Cost Optimization Checklist</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Cost Optimization checklist is a resource for driving actions after setting an optimization strategy.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cost Optimization checklist is a referenced document (checklist.md) providing next steps for cost optimization.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-475405476dbc7b00e7119497a7834c18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcd6623608bb76388ae9e58c2350270b</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/cost-optimization/principles.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776981519</data>
