</node>
<node id="Service-Level Agreements">
  <data key="d0">Service-Level Agreements</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Service-level agreements (SLAs) govern workloads and require budget allocation decisions between potential penalties and implementation efforts.&lt;SEP&gt;Service-level agreements (SLAs) are commitments from Azure indicating expected uptime levels and conditions for each service.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-475405476dbc7b00e7119497a7834c18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0ea658bc5677a379a1105409b6be36f</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/cost-optimization/principles.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/design-guides/regions-availability-zones.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776981747</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cost-Efficiency Mindset">
  <data key="d0">Cost-Efficiency Mindset</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A design principle focused on spending only on what is needed to achieve the highest return on investments.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-475405476dbc7b00e7119497a7834c18</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/cost-optimization/principles.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776981519</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cost Guardrails">
  <data key="d0">Cost Guardrails</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Cost guardrails are architectural enforcement mechanisms that keep resources within upper and lower budget limits.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-475405476dbc7b00e7119497a7834c18</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/cost-optimization/principles.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776981519</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SDLC Environments">
  <data key="d0">SDLC Environments</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Software development lifecycle environments that should be treated differently to save costs, with nonproduction environments having different features and SKUs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-475405476dbc7b00e7119497a7834c18</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/cost-optimization/principles.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776981519</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cost-Management Discipline">
  <data key="d0">Cost-Management Discipline</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Cost-management discipline is a principle focused on building a team culture with awareness of budget, expenses, reporting, and cost tracking.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-475405476dbc7b00e7119497a7834c18</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/cost-optimization/principles.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776981519</data>
