</node>
<node id="Underprovisioned Resources">
  <data key="d0">Underprovisioned Resources</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Underprovisioned or underscaled resources represent a tradeoff where cost reduction through downsizing or limiting scaling results in insufficient capacity to meet demand.</data>
