</node>
<node id="Lack Of Optimization Over Time">
  <data key="d0">Lack Of Optimization Over Time</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Lack of optimization over time is a tradeoff where neglecting performance evaluation, expertise development, and monitoring leads to missed efficiency improvements and performance degradation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a0f75cb5e98d1eaef8d795bebeeb3d64</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/cost-optimization/tradeoffs.md</data>
