</node>
<node id="Health Signal">
  <data key="d0">Health Signal</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A health signal is an individual data stream that provides insights into the operational behavior of an entity, including metrics, logs, traces, or other quality characteristics.&lt;SEP&gt;Signals used to build a comprehensive health model by correlating various data points.</data>
