<node id="Zone-Redundant Deployment">
  <data key="d0">Zone-Redundant Deployment</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A deployment model where a resource is deployed across multiple availability zones with Microsoft managing synchronization and failover.&lt;SEP&gt;A deployment model where resources are deployed across multiple availability zones, recommended for many production workloads.&lt;SEP&gt;A deployment approach that spreads resources across multiple availability zones, offering high reliability at moderate cost.&lt;SEP&gt;Zone-redundant deployment spreads application and storage tiers across multiple availability zones with built-in load balancing and synchronous replication for automatic failover.&lt;SEP&gt;Zone-redundant deployment distributes solutions across multiple availability zones within a single Azure region for high reliability.&lt;SEP&gt;A single-region deployment approach that distributes resources across multiple availability zones for redundancy.&lt;SEP&gt;A deployment approach that distributes resources across multiple availability zones within a region for resiliency.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c3c83649acd71df5d7f58cf6c4f1629c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed83bb2fdd642ffb5c3592b2c8243758&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f88755bbf9fb155be427dfc8a8708cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba037f30d06665208af1b780fac7d88b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0b79907727407bf3c0d7f73778f8c4f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac69076e8ebd4d001c0267c2edca19ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67203c92bdb0aa325b8ab2d546d9ef56</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/design-guides/regions-availability-zones.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776981731</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Zone-Redundant Deployments With Backup Across Regions">
  <data key="d0">Zone-Redundant Deployments With Backup Across Regions</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">An approach extending zone-redundant deployment by performing regular backups to a secondary region, providing protection against full region outages.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c3c83649acd71df5d7f58cf6c4f1629c</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/design-guides/regions-availability-zones.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776981731</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Multi-Region Deployments">
  <data key="d0">Multi-Region Deployments</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Deployment approach 4 that uses multiple Azure regions to distribute solutions across a wide geographical area for improved reliability or geographic distribution.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c3c83649acd71df5d7f58cf6c4f1629c</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/design-guides/regions-availability-zones.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776981731</data>
