  <data key="d0">Contoso, Ltd.</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Contoso, Ltd. is a large manufacturing company implementing a line-of-business application for financial processes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e0b79907727407bf3c0d7f73778f8c4f</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/design-guides/regions-availability-zones.md</data>
