  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Reliability" target="Design Review Checklist For Reliability">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The design review checklist is centered on evaluating and ensuring reliability in architecture design.</data>
  <data key="d9">core focus</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-efa918a51cded76ba3c94dc0ae8e7139</data>
  <data key="d11">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/reliability/checklist.md</data>
  <data key="d12">1776980937</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Reliability" target="Security">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Reliability strategies such as replication and disaster recovery increase workload surface area, and incident response urgency may lead to security control bypasses, creating tradeoffs with security goals.&lt;SEP&gt;Security controls increase complexity and critical dependencies, creating tradeoffs with reliability goals including increased misconfiguration risk, disaster recovery complexity, and rate of change.</data>
  <data key="d9">complexity,control bypass,dependencies,patching,surface area,tradeoff</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-3d1a3bf99f17f7553d47f5ea8122843f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e2cc133f2276ccf7c79c3147bf59683</data>
  <data key="d11">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/reliability/tradeoffs.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/security/tradeoffs.md</data>
  <data key="d12">1776981235</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Reliability" target="Cost Optimization">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Reliability requirements such as monitoring, testing, on-call rotations, and support contracts incur additional costs.&lt;SEP&gt;Reliability strategies like replication, over-provisioning, and observability increase costs through redundancy and operational investments that conflict with cost optimization goals.&lt;SEP&gt;Cost optimization decisions can reduce resiliency, limit recovery strategies, and increase complexity, creating tradeoffs with reliability.</data>
  <data key="d9">increased costs,operational investment,redundancy,tradeoff</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-3d1a3bf99f17f7553d47f5ea8122843f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9afb547f72466f2ff769350152ae4ee5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84ce425f3646f4ada6cca51a61f53897</data>
  <data key="d11">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/reliability/tradeoffs.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/cost-optimization/tradeoffs.md</data>
  <data key="d12">1776981585</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Reliability" target="Operational Excellence">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Reliability increases workload complexity, which increases operational elements and complicates monitoring, tracing, and documentation efforts.&lt;SEP&gt;Operational Excellence practices can increase complexity and destabilizing activities, creating tradeoffs with Reliability.</data>
  <data key="d9">complexity,increased complexity,tradeoff</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-9afb547f72466f2ff769350152ae4ee5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e9454754aa8d04d2fcd10f9b4227d89</data>
  <data key="d11">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/reliability/tradeoffs.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/operational-excellence/tradeoffs.md</data>
  <data key="d12">1776981436</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Reliability" target="Performance Efficiency">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Reliability patterns like replication and resource balancing introduce latency and over-provisioning that counter performance efficiency goals.&lt;SEP&gt;Performance efficiency decisions such as reduced replication, increased density, and increased complexity can negatively impact reliability.</data>
  <data key="d9">increased latency,over-provisioning,tradeoff</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-9afb547f72466f2ff769350152ae4ee5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94148f63b4b1385b51dfefa8ba2f3472</data>
  <data key="d11">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/reliability/tradeoffs.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/performance-efficiency/tradeoffs.md</data>
  <data key="d12">1776981332</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Reliability" target="Data Replication">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Data replication is a reliability pattern used to survive replica malfunction.</data>
  <data key="d9">design pattern,fault tolerance</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-9afb547f72466f2ff769350152ae4ee5</data>
  <data key="d11">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/reliability/tradeoffs.md</data>
  <data key="d12">1776980961</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Reliability" target="Automatic Scaling">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Automatic scaling supports reliability but its lag necessitates over-provisioning to handle sudden demand spikes.</data>
  <data key="d9">demand management</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-9afb547f72466f2ff769350152ae4ee5</data>
  <data key="d11">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/reliability/tradeoffs.md</data>
  <data key="d12">1776980962</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Reliability" target="Data Partitioning And Sharding">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Data partitioning and sharding increase complexity by requiring consistency across additional resources.</data>
  <data key="d9">complexity tradeoff</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-94148f63b4b1385b51dfefa8ba2f3472</data>
  <data key="d11">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/performance-efficiency/tradeoffs.md</data>
  <data key="d12">1776981333</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Reliability" target="Denormalization">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Denormalization introduces complexity from keeping multiple data representations synchronized, impacting reliability.</data>
  <data key="d9">complexity tradeoff</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-94148f63b4b1385b51dfefa8ba2f3472</data>
  <data key="d11">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/performance-efficiency/tradeoffs.md</data>
  <data key="d12">1776981333</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Reliability" target="Synthetic Transactions">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Performance testing with synthetic transactions in active environments risks causing malfunctions that undermine reliability.</data>
  <data key="d9">testing risk</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-94148f63b4b1385b51dfefa8ba2f3472</data>
  <data key="d11">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/performance-efficiency/tradeoffs.md</data>
  <data key="d12">1776981333</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Reliability" target="Application Performance Monitoring">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Improper use or misconfiguration of APM tooling can compromise its functionality and undermine reliability.</data>
  <data key="d9">monitoring risk</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-94148f63b4b1385b51dfefa8ba2f3472</data>
  <data key="d11">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/performance-efficiency/tradeoffs.md</data>
  <data key="d12">1776981334</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Performance Efficiency" target="Design For Scale-Out">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Design for Scale-Out is a design consideration under the Performance Efficiency principle.</data>
  <data key="d9">includes</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-f86c34d935d91c0feba2784fca188c36</data>
  <data key="d11">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-design-principles.md</data>
  <data key="d12">1776979739</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Performance Efficiency" target="Managed Compute Services">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Managed Compute Services is a design consideration under Performance Efficiency.</data>
  <data key="d9">includes</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-f86c34d935d91c0feba2784fca188c36</data>
  <data key="d11">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-design-principles.md</data>
  <data key="d12">1776979741</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Performance Efficiency" target="Resource Balancing">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Resource balancing affects the performance of requests being balanced, creating a tradeoff with performance efficiency.</data>
  <data key="d9">performance impact</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-9afb547f72466f2ff769350152ae4ee5</data>
  <data key="d11">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/reliability/tradeoffs.md</data>
  <data key="d12">1776980961</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Performance Efficiency" target="Data Replication">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Data replication introduces additional latency that consumes part of the performance budget.</data>
  <data key="d9">latency impact</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-9afb547f72466f2ff769350152ae4ee5</data>
