  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Performance Efficiency" target="Security">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Security controls like firewalls, content filters, and identity verification add latency and overhead to workload flows.&lt;SEP&gt;Performance efficiency decisions such as removing security controls, increasing surface area, and removing segmentation can compromise security.</data>
