<edge source="Performance Efficiency" target="Cost Optimization">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Performance Efficiency and Cost Optimization have tradeoffs around supply-demand balance, component count, and investment alignment.&lt;SEP&gt;Cost Optimization often improves Performance Efficiency but can also create tradeoffs that hinder performance targets.&lt;SEP&gt;Cost Optimization often improves Performance Efficiency, but there are tradeoffs where cost-saving measures can hinder performance targets and ongoing performance optimization.</data>
  <data key="d9">alignment,optimization,tradeoff</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-b284d3b10b64577458ddc2798074113b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0f75cb5e98d1eaef8d795bebeeb3d64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d1d75683e73385fab74d25019f702cd</data>
  <data key="d11">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/performance-efficiency/tradeoffs.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/cost-optimization/tradeoffs.md</data>
  <data key="d12">1776981586</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Performance Efficiency" target="Operational Excellence">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Performance Efficiency can reduce observability and increase operational complexity, creating tradeoffs with Operational Excellence.&lt;SEP&gt;Operational Excellence practices like observability and deployment models can increase resource utilization, creating tradeoffs with Performance Efficiency.</data>
  <data key="d9">resource utilization,tradeoff</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-b284d3b10b64577458ddc2798074113b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31da0f57b1bbfcf80aeba441d56d15f7</data>
  <data key="d11">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/performance-efficiency/tradeoffs.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/operational-excellence/tradeoffs.md</data>
  <data key="d12">1776981435</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Performance Efficiency" target="Observability Framework">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Observability frameworks consume system resources, potentially straining performance efficiency.</data>
  <data key="d9">resource strain</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-31da0f57b1bbfcf80aeba441d56d15f7</data>
