<edge source="Operational Excellence" target="Security">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Security complicates observability and serviceability through extensive logging, data masking, resource segmentation, and access controls that impede emergency response.&lt;SEP&gt;Operational Excellence practices can increase attack surface area, transparency risks, and reduce segmentation, creating tradeoffs with Security.</data>
